id: E03
target: src/sello/ed25519.nim
desc: pointDecode: sign-bit reconciliation comparison flip, 'if feIsNegative(x) != sign' -> 'if feIsNegative(x) == sign' -- negates x on the branch where the candidate root's sign ALREADY matches the wire sign bit, and leaves it un-negated when it doesn't, decoding every valid point to its negation.
====OLD====
  if feIsNegative(x) != sign:
====NEW====
  if feIsNegative(x) == sign:
====END====
